tics\",\n      \"Discovered By\",\n      \"Alexander Fleming\",\n      \"Further research and experimentation by Fleming and his colleagues confirmed the potent antibacterial properties of penicillin, leading to the broader development of antibiotics.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Antibiotics\",\n      \"Treat\",\n      \"Bacterial Infections\",\n      \"Antibiotics are used to treat a wide range of bacterial infections, significantly reducing the mortality and morbidity associated with these conditions.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Antibiotics\",\n      \"Prevent Spread Of\",\n      \"Deadly Diseases\",\n      \"Antibiotics help prevent the spread of deadly diseases by effectively treating bacterial infections and reducing the risk of transmission.\"\n    ]\n  ]\n}"